12	abuse.n.02	{entity.abstraction.communication.message.disrespect.abuse}	{abuse,insult,revilement,contumely,vilification}	a rude expression intended to offend or hurt	{"when a student made a stupid mistake he spared them no abuse","they yelled insults at the visiting team"}
